ow a pixelated nightmare, rendered in eerie PS1-style visuals. The only way forward is through using hand-driven locomotion inspired by Gorilla Tag, you\u2019ll crawl, climb, and scramble your way through a shifting digital hell.\n\nFind a way out\u2026 before what lurks inside the game finds you.", "short_description": "Monkephobia Reincarnated revolves when you (the player) accept a mysterious offer to keep a vintage VR game. But the moment you press 'Start,' your world goes dark trapping you inside a shifting digital hell. There\u2019s no pause button. The only way to move forward is using a hand driven locomotion inspired by Gorilla Tag. \nFind a way out\u2026 before what lurks inside finds you"}]}, "developer_name": "ECLIPSE STUDIOS", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/eclipsstudios/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ECLIPSE STUDIOS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/eclipsstudios/games?authuser=0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26039711235710271"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304212_1685077129536607_2335788286702736345_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BEFkZpFM6TkQ7kNvwEM20bi&_nc_o